<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from June 1997, issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 320 firms conducted from June 9-24. Figures in brackets show the change from February's survey.</p>
<p>ECONOMY - ASSESSMENT OF THE GENERAL ECONOMIC SITUATION</p>
<p>				Good	  Normal	  Bad</p>
<p>Germany		 1.0  (+0.0)   50.3 (+4.7)   48.7(- 4.7)</p>
<p>U.S.		   91.4  (-1.8)    8.6 (+1.8)    0.0(+-0.0)</p>
<p>Japan		   2.0  (+0.5)   34.1 (+9.5)   63.9(-10.0)</p>
<p>Britain		71.4  (-3.6)   28.3 (+4.4)    0.3 (-0.8)</p>
<p>France		  0.3  (-0.1)   57.6 (-5.7)   42.1 (+5.8)</p>
<p>Italy		   0.7  (+0.7)   66.1 (-2.5)   33.2 (+1.8)</p>
<p>ECONOMY - EXPECTATIONS FOR THE NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p>Germany		68.4  (-2.4)   31.3 (+2.8)    0.3 (-0.4)</p>
<p>U.S.		    3.5  (-2.6)   88.5 (+3.9)    8.0 (-1.3)</p>
<p>Japan		  73.0  (-1.1)   26.0 (+0.5)    1.0 (+0.6)</p>
<p>Britain		 7.6  (-3.1)   85.8 (+1.7)    6.6 (+1.4)</p>
<p>France		 53.6  (-6.6)   43.4 (+4.0)    3.0 (+2.6)</p>
<p>Italy		  35.1  (-1.7)   62.2 (+1.3)    2.7 (+0.4)</p>
<p>INDUSTRY SECTORS - PROFIT EXPECTATIONS FOR NEXT SIX MONTHS</p>
<p>			    Improve	 No change     Worsen</p>
<p>Banks		   64.4 (+4.9)   32.6 (-4.9)    3.0(+-0.0)</p>
<p>Insurance	     40.4 (+5.4)   54.5 (-4.5)    5.1 (-0.9)</p>
<p>Automotives	   82.8 (-2.1)   14.5 (+1.7)    2.7 (+0.4)</p>
<p>Chemicals	     68.5 (+0.5)   30.5(+-0.0)    1.0 (-0.5)</p>
<p>Steel		   73.7 (+1.3)   24.9 (-1.2)    1.4 (-0.1)</p>
<p>Electronics	   70.6 (+0.8)   28.7 (-1.1)    0.7 (-0.3)</p>
<p>Engineering	   82.2 (-0.2)   14.7 (-0.6)    3.1 (+0.8)</p>
<p>Consumer goods	16.7 (+1.1)   70.0 (+3.1)   13.3 (-4.2)</p>
<p>Trade		   14.2 (+2.8)   71.9(+-0.0)   13.9 (-2.8)</p>
<p>Construction	   6.8 (+1.5)   53.9 (+3.1)   39.3 (-4.6)</p>
